# --- PREDICTION for F18. Not a measurement. Basis: git diff 8931c695 b26e5efd, checked 2026-11-07. ---
# Supervisor non-test code changed: piruntime/launcher_linux.go (139 lines deleted), piruntime/profile_tooling_linux.go (6 deleted), cmd/tbound-profile (4 deleted, 6 added), plus the #71 cleanup (345b0874 is in the range).
#   So TBOUND_DIGEST, TBP_DIGEST, ENTRYPOINT_DIGEST and SRC_DIGEST are predicted to change.
# adapter/ and packaging/ DID change: git diff --name-only 8931c695 b26e5efd -- adapter packaging lists 5 files (adapter/package.json, adapter/package-lock.json, adapter/src/ipc-transport.ts, adapter/src/ipc-transport.test.ts, packaging/governed/sign_cell_image.py).
#   So BUNDLE_DIGEST and IMGDIGEST are predicted to change. BUNDLE: ipc-transport.ts is in EXTENSION_FILES (scripts/prepare_official_pi_runtime.py:36). IMGDIGEST: adapter/src is walked into the image (packaging/governed/cell_image.py:243-248), and the image is built with --epoch set to the freeze commit time (30-p3.sh:14, :21), which differs at b26e5efd. Not built.
# Measurer pair: the (8931c695, F18) pair is needed. piruntime/launcher_linux.go and profile_tooling_linux.go changed in 8931c695..b26e5efd; piruntime/host.go did not (the only host.go at 97738b6 and 8931c695).
#   supervisor/internal/productdriver/host.go is new in the range and is not the measurer's host.go.
# CAL_RO_DIGEST and CAL_RW_DIGEST: predicted UNCHANGED (the default 20-r1 mode re-verifies the installed pair).
# BASH_DIGEST and NODE_DIGEST: predicted UNCHANGED (packaging/governed/base-images.lock.json is not in the packaging diff).
# Follow-on, inferred: CFG and BASE_TD follow IMGDIGEST; LOAD_TAR_DIGEST follows the image.
